{"scene_id": "s01498", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01498.fountain", "heading": "INT. CONSERVATORY WEDDING RECEPTION - EVENING", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "GWENDA FITZALAN-OKORO", "names": ["GWENDA FITZALAN-OKORO", "GWENDA"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 3}, {"id": 1, "name": "PIERS LANGLEY-ASANTE", "names": ["PIERS LANGLEY-ASANTE", "PIERS"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 1}, {"id": 2, "name": "TABITHA NWOSU-REYES", "names": ["TABITHA NWOSU-REYES", "TABITHA"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 1}, {"id": 3, "name": "DJ", "names": ["DJ"], "gender": "m", "first": 5, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 4, "name": "LUCIO MARCHETTI-DAS", "names": ["LUCIO MARCHETTI-DAS"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 5, "name": "STRANGER", "names": ["STRANGER"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 2}, {"id": 6, "name": "DANIEL", "names": ["DANIEL"], "gender": "?", "first": 19, "spoke": 1}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. CONSERVATORY WEDDING RECEPTION - EVENING", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A Victorian glasshouse strung with paper lanterns.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Ferns and fig trees crowd the corners.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Rain drums on the panes.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Tables laid with mismatched china.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "The guests murmur around a small dance floor, six of them clustered near the cake: the bride's mother GWENDA FITZALAN-OKORO (60s, silver gown, brimming eyes), the groom's brother PIERS LANGLEY-ASANTE (30s, loosened tie), an old friend TABITHA NWOSU-REYES (40s, wine glass in each hand), the DJ (20s, headphones, bored), a caterer LUCIO MARCHETTI-DAS (50s, white jacket), and a STRANGER in a rain-soaked coat at the glass door.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "The stranger has no card, no corsage, no seat.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "He looks at the dance floor as if at a stage he once knew.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Who is that?", "name": "GWENDA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No idea.", "name": "PIERS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He's very wet.", "name": "TABITHA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "The stranger steps in.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Dripping, he crosses the floor and stops before Gwenda.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mrs. Fitzalan-Okoro. You won't remember me.", "name": "STRANGER", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I don't believe I do.", "name": "GWENDA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Twenty-six years ago, I proposed to your daughter's mother. In this room.", "name": "STRANGER", "speaker": 5, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "The DJ takes off his headphones.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Lucio sets down the tray.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Daniel.", "name": "GWENDA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["whisper"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Hello, Gwenda.", "name": "DANIEL", "speaker": 6, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "She puts a hand to her mouth.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Behind her, the music trails away.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Rain drums on the glass.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]}]}